  "design": {
    "idea": "Falling Debris Deck: fight a Comet Hound on the west marble slab, curve a bolt around the howling central gravity eddy behind a falling stone fin to snap Drop-Anchor 1 and bridge the chasm, then clear the east deck and pop Drop-Anchor 2.",
